  "details": "Bool toggles for multiple of the same objects with UV Tile Discard are often set to toggle at different percentages (25%,50%75%, ect...) on a Radial Puppet but trying to get exact percentages with Thumb sticks in VR can be difficult. I wish there was a variable in Radial Puppets which could set a custom threshold which the axis would snap to. (E.g. 0 means no snapping, 10 means it snaps in integers of 10%).",
